% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Dir2013_34_Art32_PublicOversight".

norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight is an implementation and oversight rule.

norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight has the label "Directive 2013/34/EU Article 32: Public oversight of statutory auditors".

norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight has the modality obligation.

norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight has the legal text "Member States shall provide for effective systems of public oversight for statutory auditors and audit entities.".

norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight produces action establish public oversight system.

norm dir 2013 34 art 32 public oversight is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_32".


% Things the description names but does not describe: their addresses.
action establish public oversight system is identified by "http://example.org/Action_EstablishPublicOversightSystem".


